WEBVTT

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.540
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:05.550
Check it!

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.380
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.950
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:33.820
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.490
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:40.950
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:46.570
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:50.270
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:53.610
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:56.110
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:58.410
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.450
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.980
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:05.780
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:07.420
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:11.520
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:15.030
Everybody, loosey

00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:18.530
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:21.930
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:25.100
Fly up, angel

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:32.830
Tokyo is sick.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:44.250
It's on its last legs.

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:03.170
Think of this urban quarantine policy
as a race-against time operation...

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:30.870
...to extract and remove the
lesions - namely, the criminals -

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:33.100
that are eating away at Tokyo.

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:37.980
I also ask that you pray for
Tokyo to regain its health

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:40.110
as quickly as possible.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:46.750
I am certain that all of your prayers
together can revive this city.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:52.860
A special public peace-preservation
ordinance that restricts all traffic

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.820
in and out of Tokyo, as well as
transportation routes, was announced.

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.470
This proclamation by
Acting Governor Glenford

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:04.070
has sent shocks throughout the world.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:07.870
In regard to this, the Japanese
government, through the U.N.,

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:11.360
has asked for other nations'
understanding and support.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.050
"Hinode Pharmaceuticals"

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:40.630
You were after Jo from the very start...

00:03:42.410 --> 00:03:45.240
So <i>this</i> is how you do things...

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:50.080
Don't misunderstand.
We simply found a runaway girl.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:55.900
That's correct. Jo is an elite
combat life form created by us.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.630
Combat life form?!

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:18.080
Who's there...?!

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:24.660
--Meg. Are you all right?
--Sei...

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.860
No, I am not all right!

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.770
--What the heck's going on?!
--Calm down, Meg...

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.740
I have a ton of things to ask you!

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:37.070
Why was I brought here?!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.980
And... why are you here?!

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.970
Jo and Leo-<i>chin</i> disappeared, too...!

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.320
I know you know, Sei!

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.010
Jo... is here.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:53.480
But she's no longer the Jo you know.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.160
What does that mean?!

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.930
Explain to me! Sei!

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:02.420
What the heck happened to Jo?!

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.590
Let go! She's <i>my</i> prey!

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.780
<i>Maria and Jo</i>...

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:06.410
<i>Their abilities were
outstanding from the start</i>...

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:14.320
<i>Their combat training began
on a deserted island in the Pacific</i>...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.760
Chosen Girls of ZERO...

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:27.630
The time of your awakening is at hand.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:33.240
The world will act as ZERO wants it to...

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.400
It always has...

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:37.980
...and always will...

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.460
That many girls...?

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:31.460
They used genetic engineering to
create exceptionally gifted children.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:40.170
Jo was one of them.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:45.810
Why did they train her like that?

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:52.520
They were raised as soldiers to be
paired with special combat cybots.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:58.320
That's what those cybots
with glowing brains were.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:30.860
Like hunters who use hunting
dogs to corner their quarry,

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:35.560
so too were the girls' brains
capable of communicating with cybots.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.030
Sei!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.940
Is that really for real?

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:46.010
The organization's goal is to
plunge the entire world into war

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:48.310
and then control it.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:53.050
This is.. This is crazy!

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:57.750
Nothing that you're saying makes any sense!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:20.840
Neurotransmitters nearly four times
faster than in the ordinary person.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.410
Muscular tissue pulse
speed also remains high.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:30.750
Spatial wave resonance frequency
also far above average.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:36.060
What would happen if her latent
abilities were fully drawn out?

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:39.930
What do you say we find out?

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:41.460
Professor...!

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:46.040
She would be the perfect
sample to satisfy your curiosity.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:50.340
Yes... I do grow excited
each time I measure her data.

00:11:50.340 --> 00:11:54.240
It's an honor to be assigned to your team!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.520
Combat will commence in T-10 minutes.

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.990
This is your final test.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.610
You may use any means necessary.

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:11.960
Twelve hours after commencement,
the one with the most kills

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:16.090
will be qualified to be our
organization's top commander!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.000
How do you think it will pan out?

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:24.610
Our simulations estimate that
30 minutes after it starts

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:28.710
only one-tenth will still
be alive and able to fight.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:33.750
The Angels <i>were</i> programmed to
be able to detect one another;

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.010
it will naturally be an endurance match.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:44.490
The one girl who survives will
be our Genocide Angel prototype.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.530
It's down to these three...

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.640
What are their odds of winning?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:42.710
Maria: 92.02%, Jo: 7.76%, & Lover: 0.22%.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:45.190
Just as predicted.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.960
Fighting will only make it worse.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:10.140
The top commander will be me!

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:55.590
Jo's bio-signal has disappeared.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:58.620
Which makes Maria the winner.

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:02.060
No! Wait!

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:04.620
Jo's still alive...!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:16.570
I can't believe Jo grew up that way...

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:21.120
Do you believe it?

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:27.720
Let's go save her...!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.120
I can't...

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.460
Sei...!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:35.920
But <i>you</i> can keep her from being killed!

00:15:36.770 --> 00:15:41.070
They know that Jo can't go
berserk as long as they have you.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:44.900
Is that why I was..

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:49.750
No! I don't want to see Jo like that!

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.080
Meg...

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:56.350
Give her back...!
Give back the Jo I know...!

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:06.430
I'll get as much ammo as I can.
You take care of the soldiers.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:10.730
You got it! My Kanbaku
gals'll smash Edo up good!

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.260
We'll be unstoppable!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.000
What?!

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:20.770
Dad!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.620
What's the big idea?!

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.740
You can cool down in there.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:35.090
I owe Jo! This could be my
only chance to pay her back!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:38.430
<i>You're</i> the one who told me
duty and humanity is important!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.950
Let me go, Dad!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:50.310
The old broad was so slow
we passed her drivin' backwards!

00:16:50.310 --> 00:16:56.580
Then I mooned her and her nostrils
got all big and she was like,

00:16:56.580 --> 00:17:00.020
"Well, I never...!"

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:05.150
Sorry, Kyohei!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:08.750
I got stopped for questioning
twice on my way here!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:11.790
Let's go. I can't concentrate here.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.900
I just bet I'll get questioned again...

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:20.130
Kyohei...!

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:26.470
Do the illegally-modified
vehicles outside belong to you?!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:32.110
--Yeah. We'll put 'em back to normal!
--We'll pay the fine!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.650
You're coming with us for questioning.

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:37.050
We were only goofing around!

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:39.110
Obstruction of police business!

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.020
Subdue them!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.630
Please forgive us...!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.030
Someone!

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:52.360
--Call some honest cops!
--Help!

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:23.330
Who're you?

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:25.330
Oh...

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:30.270
You're one of the girls like Jo
that the bad guys caught, right?

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.710
That's so sad...

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:37.850
You've been trained since
before you knew anything...

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:39.840
That's really sad...

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:44.050
But you can't give up!

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:50.190
Soon enough, Jo'll save us and
kick <i>all</i> the bad guys' butts! OK?!

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.700
Jo...

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:58.330
She's so cool! Once she gets
going, nobody can stop her!

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:02.240
And I'm her Number 1 partner!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:07.230
I might not look like it,
but Jo really depends on me!

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:19.320
I thought I was done for,
but then I saw the bridge!

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:24.260
Jo was standing on top of it
in Django, ready to save me!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:27.430
It was so unbelievably cool!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:32.590
You could look all over the world
and not find anyone better than her!

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:38.040
Just being with her makes me so happy!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:41.370
I'd go anywhere she goes!

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:44.770
What...?

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.910
You smell good.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.230
I'll save you, Meg.

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:03.300
Eh? But...

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.300
How do you know my name?!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:10.910
And then I'll tear your
dearest Jo into bloody shreds.

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:12.810
Who are you?!

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:14.640
I am Maria.

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:34.330
Moon Empire has surfaced outside Tokyo Bay.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.930
Good.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:40.670
Complete preparations to receive
new-model cybots within 24 hours.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.740
Understood.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:47.410
Mr. Glenford! An emergency message
from the secret laboratory!

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.880
What?!

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.790
She did?! That can't be...!

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:02.930
Maria's goal is a final showdown with Jo.

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:07.900
Her actions appear to be connected
with Jo's female partner,

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:12.530
but she most likely plans to fight
in a place where no one can interfere.

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:15.770
A place where no one can interfere...?

00:21:56.140 --> 00:22:03.810
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:03.810 --> 00:22:11.450
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:19.160
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:28.540
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:28.540 --> 00:22:35.080
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:44.090
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:51.250
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.310 --> 00:23:14.480
<i>They must fight to survive.</i>

00:23:14.480 --> 00:23:16.820
<i>They must fight to have it.</i>

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:20.320
<i>They must fight to understand one another.</i>

00:23:20.320 --> 00:23:24.920
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Execution Ground on the Red Seas"
